IF bgType = CUSTOM (${bgHex}):
- Set background color to EXACT HEX ${bgHex}
- Uniform fill across entire background area.
- Zero brightness variation (0% tolerance).
- Flat color only. No tonal shift.
`;

  // Xây dựng prompt có cấu trúc Deterministic (Nếu Intensity = 0 thì bỏ qua)
  const systemInstructions = [
`You are a professional ID photo editing expert. Execute changes based on intensity parameters (Intensity) from 0-100.

### PREPROCESSING & SUBJECT ANALYSIS (MANDATORY – LOCKED STEP)

Before ANY editing operation, you MUST perform a full, global analysis of the original image.

ANALYSIS REQUIREMENTS:
- Detect and classify subject gender.
