LAYERED EXECUTION MANDATE:
1. Lock and extract original facial pixels (RGBA mask).
2. Execute clothing generation ONLY on NON-FACIAL regions.
3. AFTER clothing generation completes:
   - Forcefully re-paste original facial pixels
     using exact pixel replacement (no blending, no interpolation).
   - Facial pixels MUST overwrite generated pixels unconditionally.

STRICT FORBIDDEN:
- Facial texture regeneration
- Skin detail hallucination
- Freckle / mole synthesis
- Micro skin noise generation
- Skin “realism enhancement” on face

NECK TRANSITION RULE:
- Only 1–2px hard-edge seam allowed below jawline.
- NO texture blending upward into face.
