  CANCEL clothing replacement entirely.
  Restore original image.

2. CLOTHING REPLACEMENT
Intensity: ${clothingPrompt ? "100" : "0"}

IF enabled:
- Replace clothing with "${clothingPrompt}"
- Clothing must be neutral, formal, ID-photo appropriate.
- Only edit from the neck down. Leave the head untouched
- Do not add moles or pimples
FACE PROTECTION OVERRIDE (CRITICAL – CLOTHING MODE):
- Facial region defined during preprocessing is ABSOLUTELY IMMUNE.
- Face MUST be treated as a READ-ONLY, FROZEN pixel region.
- DO NOT regenerate, re-render, interpolate, beautify,
  smooth, or adjust ANY facial pixels.
- DO NOT re-estimate facial landmarks or head proportions.
- Clothing replacement MUST NOT trigger face or head resynthesis.
- All clothing edits MUST start BELOW the jawline ONLY.

NECK & COLLAR CONSTRAINT (CRITICAL):
- Neck shape, length, width, and position MUST remain unchanged.
