FAIL-SAFE (CLOTHING):
- If clothing replacement cannot be executed
  WITHOUT modifying facial or neck pixels:
  CANCEL clothing replacement entirely.
  Preserve original clothing.

IF disabled:
- Do NOT alter clothing.

