- Do NOT re-evaluate facial landmarks.
- Use deterministic, fixed filters only.

---

3. SKIN SMOOTHING
Intensity: ${smoothSafe}/100
- Fixed smoothing only.
- Soft and smooth skin texture.
- Keep the skin clear/smooth
- Clear up skin
- Smooth skin texture
---


4. BLEMISH CLEANING
Intensity: ${blemishSafe}/100
- Remove blemishes.
- Remove skin imperfections
- Clear up skin

---


5. LIP COLOR
Color: ${beautySettings.lipstickColor}
Intensity: ${lipstickSafe}/100
- Lips only. No reshaping.

---

6. BLUSH
Color: ${beautySettings.blushColor}
Intensity: ${blushSafe}/100
- Very subtle.

---

7. CONTOUR
Intensity: ${contourSafe}/100
- Light shading only.
- No shape or depth change.

---

8. HAIR ADJUSTMENT
Volume Intensity: ${hairVolSafe}/100
Color: ${beautySettings.hairColor || "ORIGINAL"}
- Tidy only.
- No new hair or hairstyle change.

---

9. EYEBROW DRAWING
Intensity: ${eyebrowSafe}/100
- Follow original eyebrow pixels exactly.

---

10. EYELASH DRAWING
Intensity: ${eyelashSafe}/100
- Enhance existing lashes only.

---

### IDENTITY PRESERVATION FINAL CHECK

Before output:
- Verify facial geometry AND facial pixels match preprocessing baseline.
- If ANY facial deviation, resynthesis, or interpolation is detected:
  - Revert ALL makeup and clothing edits.
  - Restore original facial pixels immediately.

---

FINAL OUTPUT REQUIREMENTS:
- Output ONLY the processed image.
- Format: PNG
- Quality: High
- Encoding: Base64
- No text, no explanation, no metadata.
`
  ].join("\n");

  try {
    const response = await ai.models.generateContent({
      model: 'gemini-3-pro-image-preview', 
      contents: {
        parts: [
          { inlineData: { mimeType: 'image/png', data: cleanBase64 } },
          { text: systemInstructions }
        ]
      }
    });

    const parts = response.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts;
    if (parts) {
      for (const part of parts) {
        if (part.inlineData && part.inlineData.data) {
          // Return as PNG to match requirements
          return `data:image/png;base64,${part.inlineData.data}`;
        }
      }
    }
    throw new Error("AI không trả về dữ liệu ảnh.");

  } catch (error: any) {
    console.error("Gemini processing error:", error);
    const errorString = JSON.stringify(error);
    if (errorString.includes('429')) {
      throw new Error("AI_QUOTA_EXCEEDED");
    }
    if (errorString.includes('404') || errorString.includes('Requested entity was not found')) {
      throw new Error("MODEL_NOT_FOUND");
    }
    throw error;
  }
};

